#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:11
msgid ""
"Follow the spec. Don't scan for local file headers. Read the central "
"directory for file metadata. (see [No Streaming Unzip API](#no-streaming-"
"unzip-api))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:15
msgid "Don't block the JavaScript thread. Use and provide async APIs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:17
msgid ""
"Keep memory usage under control. Don't attempt to buffer entire files in "
"RAM at once."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:19
msgid ""
"Never crash (if used properly). Don't let malformed zip files bring down "
"client applications who are trying to catch errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:21
msgid "Catch unsafe file names. See `validateFileName()`."
msgstr ""

