#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:355
msgid "fileName"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:357
msgid ""
"`String`. Following the spec, the bytes for the file name are decoded "
"with `UTF-8` if `generalPurposeBitFlag & 0x800`, otherwise with `CP437`. "
"Alternatively, this field may be populated from the Info-ZIP Unicode Path"
" Extra Field (see `extraFields`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:363
msgid ""
"This field is automatically validated by `validateFileName()` before "
"yauzl emits an \"entry\" event. If this field would contain unsafe "
"characters, yauzl emits an error instead of an entry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:366
msgid ""
"If `decodeStrings` is `false` (see `open()`), this field is the undecoded"
" `Buffer` instead of a decoded `String`. Therefore, "
"`generalPurposeBitFlag` and any Info-ZIP Unicode Path Extra Field are "
"ignored. Furthermore, no automatic file name validation is performed for "
"this file name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:370
msgid "extraFields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:372
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`Array` with each entry in the form `{id: id, data: data}`, where `id` is"
" a `Number` and `data` is a `Buffer`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:375
msgid ""
"This library looks for and reads the ZIP64 Extended Information Extra "
"Field (0x0001) in order to support ZIP64 format zip files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:378
msgid ""
"This library also looks for and reads the Info-ZIP Unicode Path Extra "
"Field (0x7075) in order to support some zipfiles that use it instead of "
"General Purpose Bit 11 to convey `UTF-8` file names. When the field is "
"identified and verified to be reliable (see the zipfile spec), the the "
"file name in this field is stored in the `fileName` property, and the "
"file name in the central directory record for this entry is ignored. Note"
" that when `decodeStrings` is false, all Info-ZIP Unicode Path Extra "
"Fields are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:386
msgid ""
"None of the other fields are considered significant by this library. "
"Fields that this library reads are left unalterned in the `extraFields` "
"array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yauzl_README.md:389
